, "author": {"steamid": "76561198207815136", "personaname": "[Myuu] 9 Neneko", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/VoteMomijiInubashiriForPresident/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 5022, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4032, "last_played": 1743874544, "avatar": "8f6ff254064f362c1a9c42533828f8bae0184bd4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Story - 10/10 - Short and interesting. Story is told by logs that you would find while entering areas\nGameplay - 9/10 - Jetprawns and Ghostprawns are the worst to be encountered but gameplay is alright\nSoundtrack - 10/10 - Songs are an absolute banger tbh, 1st boss music is my favorite one out of all of em. Wish Max would get a VA someday.\nCharacters and their designs - 10/10 - Every robot is unique in every way. Hope to see more enemy robots\n\nHoping for more world building and robots on future updates", "timestamp_created": 1716494472, "timestamp_updated": 1716494472, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "165919109", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000682398", "personaname": "Tven", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tvenx2/", "num_games_owned": 189, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 2695, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2028, "last_played": 1743199354, "avatar": "72789abfbdf55ae8e229c9782c871d8a90bb783b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Needs to be played to be believed, stellar, phenomenal, and the soundtrack is sublime.\n\nGreat variety of creative and powerful weapons, like a best of FPS weapons from the last 20 years and beyond.\n\nGameplay is really fluid, with the grappling hook and jetpack upgrades you feel like Spider-Man with a gun. It also has co-op and crossplay.", "timestamp_created": 1716481026, "timestamp_updated": 1716610146, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "165892025", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095047631", "personaname": "MacBoy__Pro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MacBoy__Pro/", "num_games_owned": 358, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 1483, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1057, "last_played": 1718830900, "avatar": "e03265be41370b658c6f9d1976753d303ae66431"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game which is a lot of fun to play with a friend as well as solo runs.\r\n\r\nMy biggest issue has been trying to play in windowed/borderless mode. Not sure what the issue is, but so many times I will accidentally click out of the window and hit the windows task bar or something and the game keeps playing as I frantically try to alt+tab back in. This often leaves me taking so much damage that my run either ends or it becomes very difficult to recover.", "timestamp_created": 1716438218, "timestamp_updated": 1716438218, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "165879920", "author": {"steamid": "76561198276125072", "personaname": "0culist", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/0culist/", "num_games_owned": 133, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 1880, "playtime_last_